Package: hlaclinval
Title: Clinical-Translation Metrics for HLA Association Studies
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Matthew", "Krantz", , "your.email@vumc.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for translating HLA-disease and HLA-drug association results
    into clinical-utility metrics and study-design quantities. Computes positive
    and negative predictive value, number needed to test, and the absolute risk
    in exposed carriers for an allele used as a screening test, and provides
    exact power and minimum-detectable-odds-ratio calculations for case-control
    carrier-status associations based on Fisher's exact test. All estimators are
    documented and validated against published HLA associations.
